  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering entrepreneurship concept to conflict and earthquake-affected North West of Syria communities (SR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Entrepreneurship program aimed at fostering a culture of entrepreneurship in northwest Syria. The program focuses on three main dimensions: spreading awareness and support for entrepreneurship culture, designing curriculum and training programs for entrepreneurship education, and providing funds for participants who complete the training to establish their businesses. Key activities include raising awareness through training and campaigns, developing entrepreneurial behaviours and skills, supporting entrepreneurship events, and creating a virtual entrepreneurship incubator. The proposal underscores the importance of entrepreneurship in reducing poverty and creating stability in conflict-affected areas, emphasising the need for a comprehensive, long-term approach.</narrative>
  </description>
